    "text": "A pole stands vertically in the center of a square. When <math><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> is the elevation of the sun,&nbsp; the tip of its shadow just reaches the side of the square and is at a distance of&nbsp;<math><mn>30</mn></math> meters and <math><mn>40</mn></math> meters from the ends of that side.&nbsp;The height of the pole is",
